{"type":"standard","title":"Sam Forstag","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sam Forstag</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q139374662","titles":{"canonical":"Sam_Forstag","normalized":"Sam Forstag","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sam Forstag</span></span>"},"pageid":82103136,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Sam_Forstag_Portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Sam_Forstag_Portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":384},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/Sam_Forstag_Portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":552,"height":643},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376108126","tid":"fa0deecd-b633-11f1-b70f-9266463547fd","timestamp":"2026-09-22T03:16:18Z","description":"American political candidate and smokejumper","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Forstag","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Forstag?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Forstag?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sam_Forstag"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Forstag","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Sam_Forstag","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Forstag?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sam_Forstag"}},"extract":"Sam Forstag is an American labor union leader and former smokejumper who is the Democratic Party nominee in the 2026 election for the Montana 1st congressional district in the U.S. House of Representatives. He will face Republican nominee Aaron Flint and Libertarian nominee Nick Sheedy. The winner will replace incumbent Republican Ryan Zinke.","extract_html":"<p><b>Sam Forstag</b> is an American labor union leader and former smokejumper who is the Democratic Party nominee in the 2026 election for the Montana 1st congressional district in the U.S. House of Representatives. He will face Republican nominee Aaron Flint and Libertarian nominee Nick Sheedy. The winner will replace incumbent Republican Ryan Zinke.</p>"}